{"kind":"doc","route":"/learn-effect/07-forms-validation","title":"7. Build forms and validate boundaries","blocks":[{"t":"heading","level":1,"id":"_7-build-forms-and-validate-boundaries","children":[{"t":"text","text":"7. Build forms and validate boundaries"}]},{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"text","text":""},{"t":"strong","children":[{"t":"text","text":"Goal:"}]},{"t":"text","text":" use Craft forms for interaction and Effect Schema for data that crosses"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"a boundary."}]},{"t":"heading","level":2,"id":"forms-remain-craft-state","children":[{"t":"text","text":"Forms remain Craft state"}]},{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"text","text":"A form derives from the state it edits. Use "},{"t":"code","text":"insertForm"},{"t":"text","text":", validators and"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"code","text":"insertFormSubmit"},{"t":"text","text":" exactly as in the regular Craft path:"}]},{"t":"code","lines":[{"tokens":[{"text":"import","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" { Schema } ","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"from","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" "},{"text":"'effect'","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":";","kind":"punctuation"}]},{"tokens":[]},{"tokens":[{"text":"const","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" "},{"text":"CreateTaskInput"},{"text":" "},{"text":"=","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" Schema.","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"toStandardSchemaV1","kind":"function"},{"text":"(","kind":"punctuation"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"  Schema.","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"Struct","kind":"function"},{"text":"({","kind":"punctuation"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"    title: Schema.String,","kind":"punctuation"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"    description: Schema.String,","kind":"punctuation"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"  }),","kind":"punctuation"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":");","kind":"punctuation"}]},{"tokens":[]},{"tokens":[{"text":"const","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" "},{"text":"createTask"},{"text":" "},{"text":"=","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" "},{"text":"yield*","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" "},{"text":"mutationEffect","kind":"function"},{"text":"(","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"'createTask'","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":", {","kind":"punctuation"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"  methodSchema: CreateTaskInput,","kind":"punctuation"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"  "},{"text":"method","kind":"function"},{"text":": (","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"input"},{"text":") ","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"=>","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" input,","kind":"punctuation"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"  "},{"text":"loader","kind":"function"},{"text":": ({ ","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"params"},{"text":" }) ","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"=>","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" "},{"text":"createTaskEffect","kind":"function"},{"text":"(params),","kind":"punctuation"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"});","kind":"punctuation"}]},{"tokens":[]},{"tokens":[{"text":"const","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" "},{"text":"draft"},{"text":" "},{"text":"=","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" "},{"text":"yield*","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" "},{"text":"state","kind":"function"},{"text":"(","kind":"punctuation"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"  "},{"text":"'draft'","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":",","kind":"punctuation"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"  { title: ","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"''","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":", description: ","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"''","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":" },","kind":"punctuation"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"  "},{"text":"insertForm","kind":"function"},{"text":"(","kind":"punctuation"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"    "},{"text":"insertFormSchema","kind":"function"},{"text":"(CreateTaskInput),","kind":"punctuation"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"    "},{"text":"insertFormSubmit","kind":"function"},{"text":"(createTask),","kind":"punctuation"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"  ),","kind":"punctuation"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":");","kind":"punctuation"}]},{"tokens":[]},{"tokens":[{"text":"const","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" "},{"text":"form"},{"text":" "},{"text":"=","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" draft.form;","kind":"punctuation"}]}],"filename":"","language":"typescript","numbered":false,"firstLine":1},{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"text","text":"The exact field insertions depend on the shape of your component, but the"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"ownership rule does not change: form values and validity are Craft state; the"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"submit operation is an Effect-backed mutation."}]},{"t":"heading","level":2,"id":"for-more-advanced-form-validation","children":[{"t":"text","text":"For more advanced form validation"}]},{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"text","text":"This Effect example is enough when the main concern is validating the payload"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"at the boundary. For richer form behaviour — field-level rules, conditional"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"validators, cross-field validation, nested forms or custom typed exceptions —"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"use Craft's dedicated form API with "},{"t":"code","text":"insertFormAttributes"},{"t":"text","text":", "},{"t":"code","text":"cValidate"},{"t":"text","text":" and"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"code","text":"insertSelectFormTree"},{"t":"text","text":". See the "},{"t":"link","href":"/craft/guide/forms/","external":false,"children":[{"t":"text","text":"Forms guide"}]},{"t":"text","text":" for this"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"alternative. Effect Schema can still be kept on "},{"t":"code","text":"methodSchema"},{"t":"text","text":" to validate the"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"final payload before the Effect runs."}]},{"t":"heading","level":2,"id":"effect-schema-at-the-boundary","children":[{"t":"text","text":"Effect Schema at the boundary"}]},{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"text","text":"Effect Schema is not passed directly to Craft. Convert it to Standard Schema:"}]},{"t":"code","lines":[{"tokens":[{"text":"import","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" { Schema } ","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"from","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" "},{"text":"'effect'","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":";","kind":"punctuation"}]},{"tokens":[]},{"tokens":[{"text":"const","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" "},{"text":"CreateTaskInput"},{"text":" "},{"text":"=","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" Schema.","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"toStandardSchemaV1","kind":"function"},{"text":"(","kind":"punctuation"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"  Schema.","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"Struct","kind":"function"},{"text":"({","kind":"punctuation"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"    title: Schema.String,","kind":"punctuation"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"    description: Schema.String,","kind":"punctuation"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"  }),","kind":"punctuation"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":");","kind":"punctuation"}]}],"filename":"","language":"typescript","numbered":false,"firstLine":1},{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"text","text":"Use it for "},{"t":"code","text":"methodSchema"},{"t":"text","text":", "},{"t":"code","text":"paramsSchema"},{"t":"text","text":" or "},{"t":"code","text":"loaderSchema"},{"t":"text","text":". The decoded output"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"is what the rest of the application sees. A synchronous schema is safe for"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"method arguments and local writes; asynchronous decoding belongs in"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"code","text":"loaderSchema"},{"t":"text","text":" or in the Effect loader itself."}]},{"t":"heading","level":2,"id":"submit-failures","children":[{"t":"text","text":"Submit failures"}]},{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"text","text":"Validation failures are parse exceptions. Domain failures stay in Effect's"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"typed error channel and become "},{"t":"code","text":"exceptions().loader"},{"t":"text","text":" on the mutation. The form"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"can therefore distinguish:"}]},{"t":"list","ordered":false,"items":[[{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"text","text":"invalid input, before the Effect runs;"}]}],[{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"text","text":"a business rejection returned by the server/domain;"}]}],[{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"text","text":"an unexpected defect that should reach the technical error boundary."}]}]]},{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"text","text":"Do not put navigation, toasts or state writes inside a computed exception list."},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"Drive those actions after "},{"t":"code","text":"submit()"},{"t":"text","text":" or from an explicit process."}]},{"t":"heading","level":2,"id":"what-you-gained","children":[{"t":"text","text":"What you gained"}]},{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"text","text":"Craft owns the interaction model and Effect owns the domain validation or write;"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"their error channels remain distinct and typed."}]},{"t":"row","layout":"between","children":[{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"link","href":"/craft/learn-effect/06-layers-routing","external":false,"children":[{"t":"text","text":"← 6. Provide Layers and route the app"}]}]},{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"link","href":"/craft/learn-effect/08-testing","external":false,"children":[{"t":"text","text":"8. Test the graph →"}]}]}]}],"outline":[{"level":2,"id":"forms-remain-craft-state","text":"Forms remain Craft state"},{"level":2,"id":"for-more-advanced-form-validation","text":"For more advanced form validation"},{"level":2,"id":"effect-schema-at-the-boundary","text":"Effect Schema at the boundary"},{"level":2,"id":"submit-failures","text":"Submit failures"},{"level":2,"id":"what-you-gained","text":"What you gained"}]}